  "compatibility_notes": "Clip-on hats for the Taby 1.64 in the desktop-case of this folder's board and revision (base.stl plus back.stl, 14.03 mm deep at the top edge). Not for round-1.32.",
  "fit_test": {
    "status": "partial",
    "notes": "The clip's grip (GRIP 0.7 mm) was chosen from five printed test clips on 2026-11-20 on a Bambu Lab P2S, 0.4 mm nozzle, PLA. The nine hats are built on that clip and checked against the case meshes, but had not been printed when this was recorded."
  },
