      "nominal_layer_height_mm": 0.08,
      "infill": "15%",
      "supports": "from the bed only, under the clip's roof; blocked around the springs",
      "source": "3MF project settings"
    }
  },
  "assembly_notes": "No assembly. Push the hat straight down over the Taby's top edge, springs at the back.",
  "cad_notes": "Parametric source is included: taby_hat_clip.py (the clip) and simple_hats.py (the hats), Python with numpy and manifold3d. The 3MF projects are packed separately and are not rebuilt by these scripts.",
